                     "48x48" : "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9415554eef74e2169ce3e459c177ff75?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FLP-4.png"
                  },
                  "displayName" : "Lewis Pringle",
                  "self" : "https://stroika.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A4fe560ca-b4e1-41d1-9bdf-97b1684eda32",
                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "My first cut was to replace use of ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "   String s;",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "  s.c_str () with",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "s.As<wstring> ().c_str() - which generally work (95% of cases - rest must assign to temporary).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "But then I had a better idea.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Create a new REP that always supports wchar_* - just not by default.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "THEN - dredefine teh rep version to ALLOW returning null. If it does - then String::c_str() allocates a new rep and replaces. That means String::c_str () must be non-cost.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "So just DEPRECATE teh const version of String::c_str() - and implemtn the non-const version as above. This is a MINIMAL change, and I think solves all my issues (or mostly - still alot of work todo).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
                  "type" : "doc",
                  "version" : 1
               },
